OL,5,G0000 Fare Dodgers: At War with the Law
OL,6,     FAfter months of tracking his
OL,7,     Fmovements, investigator Lisa
OL,8,     Ftrails a suspected fare evader
OL,9,     Fthought to owe TfL over #2,500.
OL,10,     FAnd teens cause a commotion on a
OL,11,     FNottingham tram.
OL,12,G0100 Call the Bailiffs: Time to Pay Up!
OL,13,     FEnforcement Agent Alex aims to
OL,14,     Fcollect a huge #35k debt, while
OL,15,     FMark and Sam trail a woman who
OL,16,     Fowes more than a year's worth of
OL,17,     Frent - a sizable #25k - to a
OL,18,     Fprevious landlord.
