OL,5,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FThe staff and patients of
OL,7,     FBarnsley's A&E department are put
OL,8,     Funder the microscope. New Junior
OL,9,     FDoctor Alex is thrown into the
OL,10,     Fmaelstrom and faces his first
OL,11,     Fpatient.
OL,12,G0245 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FDr Natalia Spierings needs a
OL,14,     Fcolleague's help after losing the
OL,15,     Flocation of a lipoma in patient
OL,16,     FPauline's abdomen. Dr Emma
OL,17,     FMcMullen tackles a very visible
OL,18,     Fcyst on patient Steve's face.
OL,19,G0335 Home and Away
OL,20,     FThe mystery of what's happened to
OL,21,     FRoo deepens. Tane says goodbye.
OL,22,     FLacey and Dylan try again.
